# Optional config for clipgenerator. Copy to .env (never commit .env).
#
# Local MLX Whisper is the default STT — no API key required.
#
# Optional: put model cache on an external drive (large models / shared cache)
# MODEL_DIR=/path/to/your/model-cache
# HF_HOME=/path/to/your/model-cache
#
# UI/API models: small (default) | medium
# CLI (scripts/transcribe.py) also accepts turbo, large-v3, etc.
# WHISPER_MODEL=small
#
# Sound is always ffmpeg-HLS. Full-ffmpeg for picture too (slow escape hatch):
# HLS_DOWNLOADER=ffmpeg
# Do not set HLS_USE_MPEGTS=1 on X hls+hls-audio (merge to mp4 fails).
